<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
    <!--
        What the Tools view (sdk/51 F05) adds to the forms' styles (Controls.xaml): the module's icons, a switch, a segment, a card that is a
        button, the scrim of a drawer or a sheet, tiles, chips and badges. The colours come from Colors.*.xaml, which the view merges first.
        The shape is the forms' one system: containers 12, controls 6, chips and badges 8; the switch's track is a pill (10 of its 20 height).
        Contrast: text 4.5:1, the edge of a control (a card, a segment, a switch's track) and its focus ring 3:1, in each palette; the tints
        (Info, Warning, Blocked backgrounds) carry only the palette's own text colour, which the palette tests check on each of them.
    -->
    <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
        <ResourceDictionary Source="/Fadenstack.UI.Wpf;component/Themes/Controls.xaml" />
    </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

